    grid: 5-9 cols x 6-9 rows (interior >= 3x3 required)
    frame: rounded rectangle - corners are bg, all other border cells are frame_color
    frame_color: any single color != 7 (observed 3,4,6,8,9)
    interior: (h-2)x(w-2) region, mostly bg with a sparse motif
    motif:
      bbox: 1x1 to 3x3 (must fit within 3x3)
      non_bg_pixels: 1-7 cells within the bbox
      colors: 1-2 distinct non-bg colors; may include frame_color
